      "headline": "Flood Warning issued October 5 at 11:24AM EDT until October 5 at 2:30PM EDT by NWS Tallahassee FL",
      "description": "* WHAT...Flooding caused by excessive rainfall is occurring.\n\n* WHERE...Southwestern Franklin County in Big Bend Florida...\n\n* WHEN...Until 230 PM EDT.\n\n* IMPACTS...Expect many areas of slow moving or standing water.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- At 1123 AM EDT, Emergency management reported flooding and\nstanding water in the warned area. Flooding is already occurring.\nBetween 3 and 5 inches of rain have fallen\n- Some locations that will experience flooding include...\nApalachicola, Eastpoint, Bay City and Apalachicola Airport.\n- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood",
